    {
      "id": "2b45cf48-b415-49eb-be85-dc71b4546848",
      "title": "Passe pelos três cartões e observe o que muda só na parte dos idiomas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fb92410c-2490-4ece-9e17-c73333217953",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hablo español.</strong></p><p>Eu falo espanhol.</p><p>Versão mínima para quando você quer responder de forma bem direta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/90a0bf12cf134ec78495acb91c7b6ecc_b05-01-hablo-espanol.mp3?Expires=1794099397&Signature=1DdYJQkf4ymPf~RbOqJYS0gNi9z7KcrlgVUCMpfPEdSwPDQ1B0tlrkirZTWd5AwT7FyziS70J23naHoewSEYsIlXA6fW6DPyZaBrltPQrb7YnJRgxxHhb1uHdyFrvysJSG9bdSE4sONfCxxfAxiIHFOqitEa7cvBlw0YJsMxPxZiLLM6icwr1GCuz28DwiD3HIuUoNqCF7B2mu4luh~~uEExwO8oJBNU-ZtfAd47NwySsMbX-2OzEiGU7JfzRKCZGdlFvdetCNSqONXL5s2Zr4J~JRZj-VSgQ8PZoSZRY83pghKL4QlsP7N3L62j2rGNNQugSEGmLmP0iEjkETXNAQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "ac450ff7-c1be-40f0-b92a-61fcb698861f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hablo español y portugués.</strong></p><p>Eu falo espanhol e português.</p><p>Aqui, <strong>y</strong> junta dois idiomas conhecidos.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9f6db6f4a43e4468a77fafac1979073f_b05-02-hablo-espanol-y-portugues.mp3?Expires=1794099397&Signature=t-fWeoyT4F1mDLmrtb9eDs1PAEZT-vF5HEwogRBonBwQIS50HDW5JaeM~KDZshkPwyNmb-8Px34ihOmEZ5SC0Ci~Gamy2-GYTK-UX6GOCTSx6M7M4H~qlKjBrYc6CiLwHqUFgvCoPgFmqnrEveujg27~CSacoZuuAEvE6JUPQreTfYBvlfq5ShvFN03dWCorlBwx8ikBoro96bwbgARX97d5LWKOgUO2Re~oPSOj6neOkpEAaoY1bPllLJt1XfQZjx4YttcvtiC3swmJeXSRYpI3nyag7Ee6LMpoLn~3L4Fdc0NJ8viG7VpcjZHUulFn7TNYvbBtgXOfxczKY~47Vw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1ebb92f-6d1e-45c9-a77a-eb076110cc7f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Hablo español y un poco de inglés.</strong></p><p>Eu falo espanhol e um pouco de inglês.</p><p><strong>un poco de</strong> deixa a resposta mais precisa sem ficar pesada.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/87934654624e4469979a30a57ae77343_b05-03-hablo-espanol-y-un-poco-de-ingles.mp3?Expires=1794099397&Signature=fuiXHvHUTV-iWqxVAM0GY0ngFYOMXXhqhBRhDUZxw3vEghfp~QHEr1VNclZJCPPCG5iSK8-hpDRSfuBQIct~ni9iLiXKBuZdncLNtCbzffHGE3QcvZo4zKoEGqUwwNZC4XuqX5DaOTcrHrOS-x-VuRCQ4dvCkYxDrJhmfMIzW5ESmDyRPWRrbEu2RkeNfK1OpMLbHJ5BJllryoMPRPXkdPXWSuJtLgv74tALxZxkWGNWa2JNI15eWO2f7OZi5Ta9EpiIV26~i8bQbx0wo7PGbrQVOTPo24G1LglS9D3pB6FTw3fhELCBfaDAjShBQ2Ii46Cx~mjvuxNj~8oaR9VwsQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
